1. Open the about page in the Vite dev server at `http://localhost:8888/about`. Confirm a new full-viewport canvas section appears above the existing proof section.
2. Scroll with mouse wheel on the canvas — images should scroll from far (small, blurred) toward the camera (sharp, full opacity) then fade out near camera Z.
